    "source": {
      "value": "ec2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Woven from swaths of rich brocade silk and embroidered with ancient Azlanti script in golden thread, this stole imparts a noble appearance to even the homeliest of individuals when draped over the shoulders. While wearing a stole of civility, you receive a +2 item bonus to Diplomacy checks to Make an Impression with humans or Make a Request of humans, and a +2 item bonus to Intimidation checks against humans. The stole also grants you full understanding of the Azlanti language.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou gain 10 temporary Hit Points, which last for 10 minutes."
    },
